+# Review
+
+- `src/billing.ts:132` - Usage on `period.end` is counted in two periods (inclusive comparison on an exclusive end).
+- `src/billing.ts:152` - `lower = upper + 1` drops one unit per tier boundary.
+- `src/billing.ts:172-174` - Local-time midnights and ms/86_400_000 day counting break outside UTC and across DST.
+- `src/billing.ts:144` - `sort` mutates the caller's tiers array.
+- `src/billing.ts:141-143` - An empty tier list should price usage at zero instead of throwing.
+- `src/invoice.ts:102-104` - Calling `requireStatus` only for zero charges is inconsistent; non-zero charges skip the status check.
+- `src/billing.ts:130` - `fromDate` uses the server's local date, so usage near midnight lands on the wrong day.
